data: {"id": "9f878c71266e418e-thinking-parallel_evidence-767", "run_id": "9f878c71266e418e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我需要基于已有的工具结果进行根因分析。让我整理已采集的事实：\n\n**已采集的关键事实：**\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：运行中（Running），但处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，restarts=6\n2. **退出码**：exitCode=78，消息 \"back-off 5m0s restarting failed container\"\n3. **条件状态**：Ready=False, ContainersReady=False，原因：ContainersNotReady\n4. **Previous Logs 关键内容**：应用层日志显示 `{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"CONFIG_MISSING\",\"http_status\":500,...}` - 这是 **application-level 错误**，不是容器崩溃退出\n\n**关键分析：**\n\n1. **exitCode=78 的含义**：在 Unix 系统中，退出码 78 通常代表 `CONFIG_ERROR` 或 `CONFIG_MISS", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788792301116, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

